(7675592, 1254526, 24454, '<td valign="top">The first two entries I looked at in this challenge were this one and then the one that won the blue ribbon.  I couldn''t believe how amazing this was and I was certain those first two entries would take the Blue and the red.  I''m shocked it didn''t!  It''s just so crazy beautiful! I can see it on a large canvas in a big gold frame.  I can imagine the memory!!!</td>', 'The first two entries I looked at in this challenge were this one and then the one that won the blue ribbon.  I couldn''t believe how amazing this was and I was certain those first two entries would take the Blue and the red.  I''m shocked it didn''t!  It''s just so crazy beautiful! I can see it on a large canvas in a big gold frame.  I can imagine the memory!!!', '2020-09-30 02:03:44.000000', NULL, 0),
