(7675599, 1254418, 141319, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Sandy, what an amazing picture; and thank you for your nice comment on my picture. So now you add another totally "unplanned" item to my bucket list :-) - Here in South Africa we say "Eish" - so much to do, so little time :-). Hope Covid will be managed in some form soon so we can travel again. I feel SO "locked in" (we can travel within South Africa currently, but not across borders :-( ). <br/> <br/>Eish: used by South Africans to show disdain, upset or awe.</td>', 'Congratulations Sandy, what an amazing picture; and thank you for your nice comment on my picture. So now you add another totally "unplanned" item to my bucket list :-) - Here in South Africa we say "Eish" - so much to do, so little time :-). Hope Covid will be managed in some form soon so we can travel again. I feel SO "locked in" (we can travel within South Africa currently, but not across borders :-( ).  Eish: used by South Africans to show disdain, upset or awe.', '2020-09-30 02:44:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7675600, 1254418, 86218, '<td valign="top">Well done Sandy. Moments like these are indeed best spent with people we love. Congrats on the Red. Appreciate your comments on an image which I can take no credit for except to have witnessed it</td>', 'Well done Sandy. Moments like these are indeed best spent with people we love. Congrats on the Red. Appreciate your comments on an image which I can take no credit for except to have witnessed it', '2020-09-30 03:08:47.000000', NULL, 0),
