(7676006, 1254087, 259105, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/> Hi Satvinder. First of all, this is a great picture. I love the sun and the reflection of the sun on the water. <br/>I think you could''ve done two things to make this a better photo and to have scored higher. First of all the animals on the middle left are distracting, and second of all I think you could''ve saturated the greens in the tree just to make them pop just a bit more. <br/> <br/>Hope this is helpful and feel free to PM me with any questions on the critique. And good luck on challenges to come.</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club!  Hi Satvinder. First of all, this is a great picture. I love the sun and the reflection of the sun on the water. I think you could''ve done two things to make this a better photo and to have scored higher. First of all the animals on the middle left are distracting, and second of all I think you could''ve saturated the greens in the tree just to make them pop just a bit more.  Hope this is helpful and feel free to PM me with any questions on the critique. And good luck on challenges to come.', '2020-10-06 11:13:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(7676007, 1254317, 259105, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>Hey Serdar. Great photo, in my opinion, this should''ve gone further up. I think people might''ve voted you down because of the fact it''s not really a sunrise or a sunset it looks like a middle of the day sun, so next time just make sure your doing what the challenge says so that you can go higher up. But, congrats on getting no votes below five!<br/> <br/>Hope this helped you and feel free to PM me with any questions. Good luck on challenges to come!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2020-10-06 10:20:56.</i></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! Hey Serdar. Great photo, in my opinion, this should''ve gone further up. I think people might''ve voted you down because of the fact it''s not really a sunrise or a sunset it looks like a middle of the day sun, so next time just make sure your doing what the challenge says so that you can go higher up. But, congrats on getting no votes below five! Hope this helped you and feel free to PM me with any questions. Good luck on challenges to come!', '2020-10-06 11:20:28.000000', '2020-10-06 11:20:56.000000', 0),
