(7676063, 1254084, 259105, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>Hi John. Nice picture! I really like the greens and then how they contrast with the white tips of the mountains, its a really good pano. (I really need to learn to pano better). I think the reason you scored lower than this photo should have is because some people might not see sunrise when they look at it. So next time just make sure that your photo meets the challenge so you won''t get a low score on a great picture.<br/> <br/>Feel free to PM me with anymore questions!</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! Hi John. Nice picture! I really like the greens and then how they contrast with the white tips of the mountains, its a really good pano. (I really need to learn to pano better). I think the reason you scored lower than this photo should have is because some people might not see sunrise when they look at it. So next time just make sure that your photo meets the challenge so you won''t get a low score on a great picture. Feel free to PM me with anymore questions!', '2020-10-07 10:38:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7676064, 1254156, 259105, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>Hey Tulika! I think this picture is good. I really like the texture of the water. One thing I think you could do is make the water just a bit less red, and also make the greens pop just a bit more. I also think this  photo was voted down because of the fact that it''s not really a sunrise or sunset, so next time make sure that your photo matches the challenge so you can score higher.<br/> <br/>Feel free to PM me with any questions, and good luck on future challenges.</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! Hey Tulika! I think this picture is good. I really like the texture of the water. One thing I think you could do is make the water just a bit less red, and also make the greens pop just a bit more. I also think this  photo was voted down because of the fact that it''s not really a sunrise or sunset, so next time make sure that your photo matches the challenge so you can score higher. Feel free to PM me with any questions, and good luck on future challenges.', '2020-10-07 10:51:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7676109, 1254317, 106714, '<td valign="top">Hi,<br/>I am very surprised about criticism concerning the sunset time of my photo. Anybody can see the sun is not very much above the sea level in the photo. I checked EXIF information of the photo and saw the capture time as "19:45" and sunset time was "20:01" in Istanbul at given date. (Reference: timeanddate.com)<br/> <br/>Anyway, I am glad about ranking of that photo. Of course other photos ranking above my photo have much more powerful compositions. I am not too much competitive if it comes the photography. I see "challenges" of DPC here as a game only, I am showing my work to other people, and see their work. <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by photoboy19:</b></div><hr/><i> Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>Hey Serdar. Great photo, in my opinion, this should''ve gone further up. I think people might''ve voted you down because of the fact it''s not really a sunrise or a sunset it looks like a middle of the day sun, so next time just make sure your doing what the challenge says so that you can go higher up. But, congrats on getting no votes below five!<br/> <br/>Hope this helped you and feel free to PM me with any questions. Good luck on challenges to come! </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Hi,I am very surprised about criticism concerning the sunset time of my photo. Anybody can see the sun is not very much above the sea level in the photo. I checked EXIF information of the photo and saw the capture time as "19:45" and sunset time was "20:01" in Istanbul at given date. (Reference: timeanddate.com) Anyway, I am glad about ranking of that photo. Of course other photos ranking above my photo have much more powerful compositions. I am not too much competitive if it comes the photography. I see "challenges" of DPC here as a game only, I am showing my work to other people, and see their work.  Originally posted by photoboy19: Greetings from the Critique Club! Hey Serdar. Great photo, in my opinion, this should''ve gone further up. I think people might''ve voted you down because of the fact it''s not really a sunrise or a sunset it looks like a middle of the day sun, so next time just make sure your doing what the challenge says so that you can go higher up. But, congrats on getting no votes below five! Hope this helped you and feel free to PM me with any questions. Good luck on challenges to come! ', '2020-10-07 16:34:23.000000', NULL, 0);
